 "Kolej Vokasional: vocational certificates for skilled trades.": "Kolej Vokasional：技术行业的职业证书。",
 "Public library: self-study, tuition gigs and freelance work.": "公共图书馆：自学、补习零工和自由职业。",
 "Dewan Komuniti: public speaking club and community events.": "Dewan Komuniti：演讲俱乐部和社区活动。",
