 "Hospital: doctors, nurses and treatment for the sick and injured.": "医院：医生、护士，为病人和伤者治疗。",
 "A lake: a walk round the shore, fishing off the jetty, picnics. Not built on.": "湖：绕湖散步、在码头钓鱼、野餐。不作开发。",
 "A forested hill with a trail and a viewpoint at the top. Not built on.": "一座有步道、山顶有观景台的森林山丘。不作开发。",
 "A forest reserve with a waterfall and a rock pool. Not built on.": "一片有瀑布和岩池的森林保护区。不作开发。",
 "A private school, owned by a resident. Fee-paying families send their children here; the owner pays the teachers.": "一所私立学校，由居民拥有。付费的家庭送孩子来这里；东主支付教师薪水。",
 "A private hospital, owned by a resident. Richer patients pay more for quicker care; the owner pays the doctors and nurses.": "一所私立医院，由居民拥有。较富有的病人付更多钱以更快就医；东主支付医生和护士薪水。",
