 "Kilang: factory operator and engineer jobs.": "Kilang：工厂操作员和工程师工作。",
 "Bengkel: mechanics and repair gigs.": "Bengkel：技工和修理零工。",
 "Gudang: despatch riders and logistics.": "Gudang：送货员和物流。",
 "Construction site: hard, risky labour.": "建筑工地：辛苦、危险的劳动。",
