 "Fine-dining restaurant. High-tier: expensive, very satisfying, a place to be seen.": "高级餐厅。高档：昂贵、非常令人满足、让人看见的地方。",
 "Sky lounge on the rooftop. High-tier nightlife where the well-off network.": "屋顶空中酒廊。富裕人士社交的高档夜生活。",
