 "Golf & country club. The most exclusive venue in town: members only, where deals are made.": "高尔夫与乡村俱乐部。镇上最排外的场所：只限会员，生意在这里谈成。",
 "Stesen Keretapi: trains to the big city. Newcomers arrive and leavers depart here; commuters ride to city jobs.": "Stesen Keretapi：通往大城市的火车。新来者在这里抵达，离开者在这里出发；通勤者坐车去城里上班。",
 "Railway line to the big city.": "通往大城市的铁路。",
 "Masjid: Friday prayers, the zakat and infaq fund, Ramadan and Hari Raya.": "Masjid：周五聚礼、天课与施舍基金、斋月和开斋节。",
 "Chinese temple (Buddhist and Taoist): prayers, offerings and the temple welfare fund.": "华人庙宇（佛教和道教）：祈祷、供奉和庙宇福利基金。",
