 "Balai Polis: the police station. Patrol cars go out from here; arrest chances depend on police strength.": "Balai Polis：警察局。巡逻车从这里出发；逮捕概率取决于警力。",
 "Mahkamah: the magistrates' court. Most cases end in conviction; a lawyer helps those who can pay.": "Mahkamah：推事庭。大多数案件以定罪告终；律师帮助付得起钱的人。",
 "Penjara: the prison. Inmates lose their jobs; a record makes hiring harder and reoffending likelier.": "Penjara：监狱。囚犯失去工作；前科让求职更难、更容易再犯。",
 "Lokap: the police lock-up. Suspects wait here on remand until the court hears their case.": "Lokap：警察拘留所。嫌犯在这里候审，直到法庭审理案件。",
 "Dewan Bandaraya: the town hall, office of the elected leader. The treasury collects taxes and pays for police, aid and services.": "Dewan Bandaraya：市政厅，民选领导人的办公室。财政收税并支付警察、援助和服务。",
 "Padang: the town field, where election rallies gather.": "Padang：小镇广场，竞选集会在这里举行。",
