 "Community fund": "社区基金",
 "Malaysia ~RM800 incl. oil": "马来西亚约 RM800（含石油收入）",
 "Floods hit low-lying and riverside homes in the north-east monsoon; the treasury pays RM1,000 relief per household (like Bantuan Wang Ihsan). Haze hurts health, most of all for the old and very young.": "东北季风期间水灾会淹没低洼和河边的住宅；财政每户发放 RM1,000 救济（类似 Bantuan Wang Ihsan）。烟霾损害健康，对老人和幼儿最严重。",
 "Each law is a real lever in the engine: tax rates, the minimum wage on every job, cash aid and basic income paid each month, how many police officers, teachers, nurses and doctors the town employs, how drug users are treated, university fees, whether employers may check records, a hiring preference, whether the bar is open, fuel subsidies and SST or GST.": "每条法律都是引擎中的真实杠杆：税率、每份工作的最低工资、每月发放的现金援助和基本收入、小镇雇用多少警员、教师、护士和医生、如何对待吸毒者、大学学费、雇主能否查前科、招聘优先、酒吧是否开放、燃油补贴，以及 SST 或 GST。",
 "Taxes follow Malaysia: LHDN income tax bands (0-30%, RM9,000 relief, RM400 rebate, zakat rebated), SME company tax (15/17/24%), SST inside prices (or GST 6% if the law changes), assessment tax on homes and premises, the 2% dividend tax above RM100k, and EIS contributions. Most residents earn too little to pay income tax, as in Malaysia, so sales and company taxes matter more. Money goes out on public servants' pay, public hospitals, fuel subsidies, welfare, aid, pensions, training, development and interest. A surplus builds a three-month reserve, then development projects, training places and Khazanah Rezeki; a deficit draws on the fund, then borrows. Deep debt brings a hiring freeze and austerity.": "税收依照马来西亚：LHDN 所得税税级（0-30%，RM9,000 减免，RM400 回扣，天课可抵扣）、中小企业公司税（15/17/24%）、含在价格中的 SST（若法律改变则为 6% GST）、住宅和商业物业的门牌税、超过 RM100k 的 2% 股息税，以及 EIS 缴款。和马来西亚一样，大多数居民收入太低不用缴所得税，所以销售税和公司税更重要。支出用于公务员薪水、公立医院、燃油补贴、福利、援助、退休金、培训、发展和利息。盈余先建立三个月储备，然后用于发展项目、培训名额和 Khazanah Rezeki；赤字先动用基金，再借款。深度负债会带来招聘冻结和紧缩。",
 "Bank Negara sets the Overnight Policy Rate each year (2.75% in 2026): up when inflation runs hot or the economy booms, down in recessions. It sets savings and loan rates, cools or warms business and hiring, and nudges inflation. EPF savings earn a yearly dividend (about 5.5%). Khazanah Rezeki invests the treasury's surplus in the Bursa index and the GLCs, returns 4% of its value each year, and is drawn on before the town borrows.": "国家银行每年设定隔夜政策利率（2026 年为 2.75%）：通胀过热或经济繁荣时上调，衰退时下调。它决定存款和贷款利率，让企业和招聘降温或升温，并影响通胀。EPF 储蓄每年获得股息（约 5.5%）。Khazanah Rezeki 把财政盈余投资于 Bursa 指数和官联公司，每年回报其价值的 4%，并在小镇借款前先被动用。",
 "Leaders who care less about merit may appoint relatives over abler people. The anti-corruption commission (MACC) can catch officials who take kickbacks or bribes.": "不太看重能力的领导人可能任命亲戚而不是更能干的人。反贪委员会（MACC）能抓到收受回扣或贿赂的官员。",
 "Government-linked companies (Tenaga Rezeki, Petroliam Rezeki, Bank Pembangunan Rezeki) list on Bursa Rezeki once the town's finances have matured (after about 8 years without heavy debt).": "官联公司（Tenaga Rezeki、Petroliam Rezeki、Bank Pembangunan Rezeki）在小镇财政成熟后（约 8 年没有沉重债务）在 Bursa Rezeki 上市。",
