 "Winter storms flood low-lying and riverside homes; the council pays £500 recovery help per household. Summer heatwaves hurt health, most of all for the old and very young.": "冬季风暴淹没低洼和河边的住宅；市议会每户发放 £500 恢复援助。夏季热浪损害健康，对老人和幼儿最严重。",
 "Each law is a real lever in the engine: tax rates, the minimum wage on every job, cash support and basic income paid each month, how many police officers, teachers, nurses and doctors the town employs, how drug users are treated, university fees, whether employers may check records, positive action in hiring, whether the pub is open, fuel duty and VAT.": "每条法律都是引擎中的真实杠杆：税率、每份工作的最低工资、每月发放的现金支持和基本收入、小镇雇用多少警员、教师、护士和医生、如何对待吸毒者、大学学费、雇主能否查前科、招聘中的积极措施、酒馆是否营业、燃油税和增值税。",
 "Taxes follow England: income tax bands (20/40/45% above the £12,570 personal allowance) and National Insurance (8% for workers, 15% for employers), corporation tax (19% to £50k profit, 25% above £250k, marginal relief between), VAT 20% with food zero-rated, council tax, dividend tax above £500 and inheritance tax at 40% above £325k. Universal Credit tops up low household incomes (55% taper), Child Benefit goes to parents, everyone gets the State Pension from 66, student loans are repaid at 9% above £25,000, and the NHS is free at the point of use.": "税收依照英格兰：所得税税级（超过 £12,570 个人免税额部分 20/40/45%）和国民保险（工人 8%，雇主 15%）、公司税（利润 £50k 以下 19%，£250k 以上 25%，中间边际减免）、食品零税率的 20% 增值税、市政税、超过 £500 的股息税，以及超过 £325k 部分 40% 的遗产税。Universal Credit 补贴低收入家庭（55% 递减），儿童福利发给父母，66 岁起人人领取国家养老金，学贷在收入超过 £25,000 部分按 9% 偿还，NHS 就医免费。",
 "The Bank of England sets Bank Rate (3.75% in 2026); the town economy moves it between 0.25% and 5.25%.": "英格兰银行设定银行利率（2026 年为 3.75%）；小镇经济让它在 0.25% 到 5.25% 之间变动。",
 "Leaders who care less about merit may appoint friends over abler people. The Serious Fraud Office can catch officials who take kickbacks or bribes.": "不太看重能力的领导人可能任命朋友而不是更能干的人。严重欺诈办公室能抓到收受回扣或贿赂的官员。",
 "There are no government-linked companies; the council puts its surplus into the Rexbury Investment Fund.": "没有官联公司；市议会把盈余放入 Rexbury 投资基金。",
