 "HMP Rexbury, the prison. Inmates lose their jobs; a record makes hiring harder and reoffending likelier.": "HMP Rexbury 监狱。囚犯失去工作；前科让求职更难、更容易再犯。",
 "Custody suite: suspects wait here on remand until the court hears their case.": "羁押室：嫌犯在这里候审，直到法庭审理案件。",
 "Town hall, office of the elected mayor. The council collects taxes and pays for police, support and services.": "市政厅，民选市长的办公室。市议会收税并支付警察、支持和服务。",
